{"product_id":"smok-pozz-pro-25w-pod-system","title":"SMOK POZZ PRO 25W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eCheck out SMOK POZZ PRO 25W Pod System, featuring an internal 1100mAh battery, 5-25W output range, and holds up to 2.6mL of your favorite eJuice.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"SMOK LP1 Coil Series\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-lp1-replacement-coils\"\u003eSMOK LP1 Coil Series\u003c\/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003eSMOK POZZ PRO Replacement Pods\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/files\/SMOK_Pozz_Pro_Infographic.jpg?v=1681425247\" alt=\"SMOK POZZ PRO infographic\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConstructed from durable zinc-alloy, the chassis of the SMOK POZZ PRO Pod System offers a durable exterior that is visually striking as well. In addition, the 5-25W output range works perfectly with the SMOK LP1 Coil Series to deliver delicious flavor from your favorite eJuice or nicotine salts. Equipped with an adjustable airflow control system, the POZZ Pro is perfect for all types of vapers and is incredibly portable, fitting neatly in the bookbag, purse, or pocket.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSMOK POZZ PRO 25W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 106.5mm by 29mm by 12.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 1100mAh Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 5-25W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Output Range: 1.5-4.0V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Range: 0.6-2.5ohm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eZinc-Alloy Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual Firing System - Button or Draw Activated\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.69\" OLED Display Screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow Control\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2.6mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSide Fill System - Silicone Stoppered\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSMOK LP1 Coil Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.9ohm LP1 Meshed MTL Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePress Fit Coil Installation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C USB Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 POZZ PRO Device\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 POZZ PRO Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 0.9ohm LP1 Meshed MTL Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41775215280183,"sku":"Smok Pozz Pro Pod System","price":4280.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_-_pozz_pro_kit_-_pod_system_-_all_colors.png?v=1752512495","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-pozz-pro-25w-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




